      ],
      "en": "Because for your sake, I have borne reproach. Shame has covered my face.",
      "ko": "내가 주를 위하여 훼방을 받았사오니 수치가 내 얼굴에 덮였나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "dbffe8f60adfc7d37efbacc963ae902479abb181db6ec803de68108ac8bbde6c",
      "translation_text_hash": "1646715576e9763c235a603d6d78a07ac58b3aa4038d50dea7f7a8c1c11fba65",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
